# Scratch: one-off patch scripts, notes and plans, by convention `_`-prefixed.
# They are working files for a single change and are worthless once it lands -
# `_fence.py` sat in the tree for months after the fix it applied was merged,
# and an automated PR later tried to "fix" the repo by editing it.
/_*
